  "why_this_card": "It is the only documented business option with a clearly stated 2.5% operations rate and a credit-limit range that can reach $100,000 or more. The Business Gold card's approved limit may range from $37,500 to $225,000, subject to underwriting.",
  "key_cautions": [
    "You need an approved credit limit of at least $100,000 to place the entire purchase on the card.",
    "Eligibility requires at least a 735 personal credit score and, for an established business, a PAYDEX score of 67.",
    "Rewards depend on Apple Music's merchant category code. The 2.5% rate is not guaranteed; the $800 figure is the more prudent estimate.",
    "Pay the balance in full if possible. Interest on a carried balance could outweigh the rewards."
  ],
  "bottom_line": "For planning purposes, choose the Business Gold Rewards Card only if you qualify and can obtain a $100,000-or-greater limit, but budget for an estimated net return of $800 rather than the $2,300 best-case result."
